n in a different color. This provides a visual overview of the venue. (Premium feature)":["Kundene vil se et interaktivt setekart der de kan klikke p\u00e5 tilgjengelige seter. Oppdaterte seter vises i en annen farge. Dette gir en visuell oversikt over arenaen. (Premium-funksjon)"],"Seat":["Sete"],"Seating Plan":["Seteplan"],"Description":["Beskrivelse"],"Activate":["Aktiver"],"Active":["Aktiv"],"Inactive":["Inaktiv"],"Status":["Status"],"Export CSV":["Eksporter CSV"],"Edit":["Rediger"],"Delete":["Slett"],"Cancel":["Avbryt"],"Drag to reorder":["Dra for \u00e5 endre rekkef\u00f8lge"],"Remove":["Fjern"],"Label":["Etikett"],"Name":["Navn"],"Show Layout":["Vis oppsett"],"Hide Layout":["Skjul layout"],"Delete %d seats?":["Slett %d seter?"],"%d seats updated":["%d seter oppdatert"],"%d seats deleted":["%d seter slettet"],"%d seats processed, %d errors":["%d seter behandlet, %d feil"],"selected":["valgt"],"-- Action --":["-- Handling --"],"Deactivate":["Deaktiver"],"Layout":["Oppsett"],"Seats":["Plasser"],"Actions":["Handlinger"],"Visual (Seat Map)":["Visuelt (setekart)"],"Simple (Dropdown)":["Enkel (rullegardin)"],"View Venue Photo":["Vis stedsbilde"],"Open Designer":["\u00c5pne designer"],"Manage Seats":["Administrer seter"],"Clone":["Klon"],"Edit Seating Plan":["Rediger seteplan"],"New Seating Plan":["Ny plasskart"],"Failed to load designer script":["Klarte ikke laste designer-skript"],"Designer failed to load":["Designer kunne ikke lastes"],"Click to view published version":["Klikk for \u00e5 se publisert versjon"],"Published":["Publisert"],"Click to view\/edit draft":["Klikk for \u00e5 se\/redigere utkast"],"Draft":["Utkast"],"Back to Plans":["Tilbake til planer"],"Visual Designer":["Visuell designer"],"Loading designer...":["Laster inn designer\u2026"],"Use Visual Designer to add seats":["Bruk Visual Designer for \u00e5 legge til plasser"],"This plan uses Visual Layout. Add and delete seats using the Visual Designer. You can edit seat details (label, category) here."